# Vercel deploy exclusions.
#
# The repository root IS the Vercel deploy root, so anything committed here is
# publicly served unless it is listed below.
#
# This file became necessary when apps/quran-app/android/ started being tracked
# in git (it holds release-critical native state that CI was otherwise
# regenerating from scratch). Without these rules the Gradle build files, the
# Android manifest and the gradle wrapper would be reachable at
# https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/.../android/app/build.gradle

# Android native projects — needed in git, never served over HTTP.
# Build-generated APKs/AABs live under android/ (already excluded below).
# apks/*.apk at the repo root are the intentional OTA release channel and
# MUST stay served: the in-app update checkers of all six shipped apps
# download from /apks/*.apk via updates.json.
**/android/
**/.gradle/
**/*.aab
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/keystore.properties

# Build inputs and outputs that the site does not serve.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/www/
**/.idea/

# Local tooling and notes.
.agents/
.opencode/
.pi/
.testsprite/
.claude/
**/*.log
